<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9.764 bln bfr in Nov.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9.764 bln bfr in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-Nov   change in mth  change in 1996</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     6,976.4   -23.4	     +271.1</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   668.1    -4.7	     -130.8</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     1,864.9   +22.1	     +207.6</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   204.2   -85.5		-81.2</p>
<p>    net debt		 9,764.3   -75.3	     +243.5</p>
<p>    net borrowing requirement	+17.0	     +341.8</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
